+# C06 learner acceptance matrix
+
+Each retained workflow, where the desktop proves it, and what stays with
+Academy web. Rust: `crates/desktop-core/tests/academy_program` (production
+authority interface, synthetic Academy over TLS). React:
+`apps/desktop/src/features/academy/*.test.tsx` (Academy's own pages over the
+production desktop transport). Academy: the pinned Academy suites (desktop
+lab runner, Home, award toasts, lab section hosts, navigation parity).
+Native: `docs/planning/evidence/C06/native-acceptance.json` (C06-N01..N11)
+against the synthetic endpoint (`tools/native-acceptance/academy_program.py`).
+
+| Workflow | Desktop behavior | Rust | React / Academy | Native |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| W53 final assessment | Academy's eligibility, attempt and deadline; the countdown (session-critical header status) in view, submitting once at Academy's deadline; literal start/answer/submit; a 5xx submit is an unknown outcome, sent once, reconciled by `exam.submissionState`; Academy's pending review or grade shown; a retry is the learner's, for the same attempt; leaving the attempt or changing generation stops the timer | `exam_requests_pass_literally_and_academy_timing_comes_back_untouched`, `a_failed_submission_reports_an_unknown_outcome_once_and_reconciles_by_query` | `final assessment` (2), `assessment timer` (4) | N02, N03 (keyboard), N12 (deadline) |
+| W53 identity practical | Learner status and submission; the assessor queue and review stay on Academy web (`assessorTools=false`), never fetched | `assessor_grading_and_award_procedures_are_refused_before_any_request` | route sweep `/assessment/identity-practical`; Academy identity-practical tests | — (reached from identity-course pages the synthetic catalog does not carry) |
+| W53 certificates | Academy's issued certificate; verify URL on Academy web's origin; download through the native print sheet (`PrintPage`, observed: a sheet that cannot open is reported), no state change | `print_opens_the_native_sheet_once_and_changes_no_state`, `a_print_sheet_that_cannot_open_says_so_and_changes_nothing` | `certificates` (2) | N04 |
+| W53 Program | Academy's hub with exams, certificates, dossier, requisitions, weekly board | — | route sweep `/program`, `/dossier`, `/leaderboard`, `/shop` | N01 |
+| W51/W53 guided labs | Academy's desktop attempt contract: start per request id, versioned drafts with mutation ids saved one at a time (an older reply never replaces a newer confirmed version), grading on a confirmed version with a submission id, conflicts shown, unsupported labs previewed, locked attempts explained | `desktop_lab_idempotency_keys_and_versions_reach_academy_unchanged` | `academy-view` lab test; Academy `desktop-lab-runner` (5), `use-desktop-draft` (3), `unit-lab-section-hosts` | N05 |
+| W52 Home / gamification | Academy's briefing (level, XP, streak, objective); away commendations and event claims left to Academy web (`awardPresenters=false`); best-effort beacons silent | — | route sweep `/`; Academy `home-page` award presenters, `use-award-toasts` | N01 |
+| W54 account | Academy's settings read/update; sign-out through the desktop; appearance stays with the app; avatar chosen, checked, stored at a reviewed destination and confirmed by the core, read back as a `data:` image, cancelled with nothing sent, removed through Academy | `an_avatar_is_checked_stored_at_the_presigned_destination_and_confirmed`, `an_avatar_upload_sends_nothing_when_cancelled_or_the_image_is_not_acceptable`, `an_avatar_never_goes_to_an_unreviewed_destination_or_past_a_failed_step`, `only_a_signed_in_current_learner_may_upload_an_avatar`, `the_avatar_is_read_back_from_academys_origin_as_a_data_url_only` | `learner account` (8); Academy `learner-image` | N08, N13 |
+| W54 export | Certificate download (print/save) is the learner export Academy offers; a sheet that cannot open is reported and changes nothing (executed: scripted printer, fixture flag) | `a_print_sheet_that_cannot_open_says_so_and_changes_nothing` | `certificates` | N04 |
+| W54 feedback | A completed lesson asks for a rating (retained from v1; off on Academy web) and sends one `admin.feedback.submit` with module, lesson and rating; an unfinished lesson does not ask | — | `lesson feedback` (2) | N15 |
+| W65 Shift | Serve/answer/decide sent as written; slow optional briefing never holds the timed answer or serve; stale optional 401 cannot retire a newer account | `a_slow_optional_briefing_never_blocks_a_timed_shift_answer`, `a_late_unauthorized_reply_for_an_earlier_generation_never_retires_the_newer_account` | `shift` | N06 |
+| W66 course reset/removal | Reset (retained from v1) and removal behind Academy's confirmations: counts or affected certifications and courses, earned certificates kept; one request on confirm, none on Cancel | — | `course removal` (3) | N07, N14 |
+| T11 authority | Forged verdict/award/clock fields are never sent; assessor, grading, override, award and admin procedures refused before a request; no answer key in the bundle or AX trees | `assessor_grading_and_award_procedures_are_refused_before_any_request` | truth gate; route sweep | N09, N02 |
+| T12 duplicates and drafts | Duplicate submission ids forwarded as asked (Academy answers from its receipt); a changed draft version is Academy's `CONFLICT` | `desktop_lab_idempotency_keys_and_versions_reach_academy_unchanged` | Academy `desktop-lab-runner` conflict and unknown-outcome tests | N05 |
+| T09 native UI | Keyboard-only assessment, alert-region announcement, zoom and minimum size, isolation from other features | — | — | N03, N10, N11 |
+
+Mutation probes: `docs/planning/evidence/C06/mutation-probes/`.
